Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,H_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak rasa boleh lari daripada saya?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.40,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak rasa boleh lolos daripada saya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:04.17,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Nasihat saya: jangan cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:11.22,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bang, ampunkan saya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:13.02,S_ms,,0,0,0,,pasal pukul tu saya hanya anak buah kecil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.42,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Botak yang arahkan semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.83,S_ms,,0,0,0,,semalam kami pun pergi ke tanah perkuburan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.77,S_ms,,0,0,0,,dan bermalam di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.83,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Semua arahan awak saya buat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tengok,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.92,S_ms,,0,0,0,,cedera saya belum sembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:25.92,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya minta, ampunkan saya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.72,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bangun. Saya ada hal nak tanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.63,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Biar dia tunggu di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.82,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tunggu saya di hadapan ye, sayang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.13,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bang, saya hanya ikut arahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.07,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.45,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tenang, cuma beberapa soalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:41.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:43.62,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Botak dah mati, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.80,S_ms,,0,0,0,,A-awak tahu?!
